{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To determine the number of ways to choose 4 different officers (President, Vice President, Treasurer, and Secretary) from a club of 9 people, we need to consider that the order in which we select the officers matters (since each position is distinct). This is a permutation problem.\n\nHere are the steps to solve it:\n\n1. **Choose the President**: There are 9 possible choices for the President.\n2. **Choose the Vice President**: After selecting the President, there are 8 people left to choose from for the Vice President.\n3. **Choose the Treasurer**: After selecting the President and Vice President, there are 7 people left to choose from for the Treasurer.\n4. **Choose the Secretary**: After selecting the President, Vice President, and Treasurer, there are 6 people left to choose from for the Secretary.\n\n","prefix_end":809,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,8253,279,1372,315,5510,311,5157,220,19,2155,9611,320,26137,11,22461,4795,11,87875,11,323,12386,8,504,264,6335,315,220,24,1251,11,582,1184,311,2908,429,279,1973,304,892,582,3293,279,9611,12850,320,11284,1817,2309,374,12460,568,1096,374,264,58441,3491,382,8420,525,279,7354,311,11625,432,1447,16,13,3070,24051,279,4795,95518,2619,525,220,24,3204,11454,369,279,4795,624,17,13,3070,24051,279,22461,4795,95518,4636,26301,279,4795,11,1052,525,220,23,1251,2115,311,5157,504,369,279,22461,4795,624,18,13,3070,24051,279,87875,95518,4636,26301,279,4795,323,22461,4795,11,1052,525,220,22,1251,2115,311,5157,504,369,279,87875,624,19,13,3070,24051,279,12386,95518,4636,26301,279,4795,11,22461,4795,11,323,87875,11,1052,525,220,21,1251,2115,311,5157,504,369,279,12386,382,1654,30270,279,1372,315,11454,369,1817,2309,311,1477,279,2790,1372,315,5510,311,9793,1493,12783,1447,59,9640,24,1124,15136,220,23,1124,15136,220,22,1124,15136,220,21,198,59,2533,7039,11,1077,594,2736,279,4644